I brought this to the attention of the dev team and they came up
with a couple of fixes; use whichever you want:

        @test -r lev_lex.o > /dev/null
or
        @test -r lev_lex.o || exit 1

The point is that "make" tries to bypass /bin/sh unless shell
metacharacters are present.

